{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Mansion of a Million Monsters!</strong>,\u00a0<strong>investigate</strong> a wacky cartoon mansion chock full of <strong>fiendish animatronics</strong>, <strong>dastardly traps</strong>, and <strong>zany suspects</strong>! Crack each case to\u00a0<strong>unmask</strong> the monsters and <strong>uncover</strong> the mysteries of the mansion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627210/extras/b3c40f99e1f75fe5c453956fb44e6092.poster.avif?t=1758143503\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627210/extras/b3c40f99e1f75fe5c453956fb44e6092.webm?t=1758143503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627210/extras/b3c40f99e1f75fe5c453956fb44e6092.mp4?t=1758143503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627210/extras/5ed768fe31cd0a565543e0da2bb19215.poster.avif?t=1758143503\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627210/extras/5ed768fe31cd0a565543e0da2bb19215.webp?t=1758143503\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Investigate Haunted Mansions!\" width=700 height=220 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627210/extras/a8e8adbdce19b3d924ddb56c80c0b24f.poster.avif?t=1758143503\" aria-label=\"Footage exploring the mansion and finding a clue in a room\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627210/extras/a8e8adbdce19b3d924ddb56c80c0b24f.webm?t=1758143503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627210/extras/a8e8adbdce19b3d924ddb56c80c0b24f.mp4?t=1758143503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a winding and wacky mansion as you hunt for clues on your adventure</strong>. But watch out! These halls are filled with all sorts of devious traps and animatronic enemies! And the Mansion <i>seems to change in mysterious ways between each case</i>...</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to the bottom of the mystery by interrogating a zany cast of suspects! As you find more clues, they divulge more information!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the suspect\u2019s rooms and sniff out the clues. Beat puzzley minigames to add evidence to your clue journal!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But things can\u2019t be that easy\u2026as you collect clues, the Monster of the Week will appear to chase you away!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627210/extras/b1e58711a08586660f4051e4dce4c63c.poster.avif?t=1758143503\" width=700 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627210/extras/b1e58711a08586660f4051e4dce4c63c.webm?t=1758143503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627210/extras/d7a994348c3b05d133a8c9d1fff9655d.poster.avif?t=1758143503\" aria-label=\"Footage fighting the monsters and unmasking dracula\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627210/extras/d7a994348c3b05d133a8c9d1fff9655d.webm?t=1758143503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627210/extras/d7a994348c3b05d133a8c9d1fff9655d.mp4?t=1758143503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dracula, the Werewolf, the Mummy, and more</strong> prowl the halls of Orchard Mansion!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get enough clues and the Monster of the Week appears! <i>YIKES!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Monster of the Week appears multiple times throughout their episode, each time meaner than last!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find enough clues to <strong>incriminate the culprit</strong>, <strong>set your trap</strong>, and <strong>defeat the Monster</strong> to finally <strong>unmask it</strong>!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play in Story Mode, or Mix it Up!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Story Mode</strong>, investigate and fight your way through several cases to unravel the mystery of Orchard Mansion. Each case features a different Monster of the Week with its own set of abilities and minions, along with a unique cast of suspects and map layout to keep things fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Mixed-Up Mansion Mode</strong>, the mansion layout, suspects, and clues are randomized to mix up the way you play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the case <strong>solo</strong> or with up to 4 players in <strong>local co-op</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3627210?t=1758143503","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627210/0acba3f493abccd1c6f24fa2e2fdc3bb78a03a51/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758143503","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627210/781bda7175e3633832ae70f501a503b4519f2ee5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758143503","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627210/781bda7175e3633832ae70f501a503b4519f2ee5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758143503","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Mansion of a Million Monsters!</strong>,\u00a0<strong>investigate</strong> a wacky cartoon mansion chock full of <strong>fiendish animatronics</strong>, <strong>dastardly traps</strong>, and <strong>zany suspects</strong>! Crack each case to\u00a0<strong>unmask</strong> the monsters and <strong>uncover</strong> the mysteries of the mansion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627210/extras/b3c40f99e1f75fe5c453956fb44e6092.poster.avif?t=1758143503\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627210/extras/b3c40f99e1f75fe5c453956fb44e6092.webm?t=1758143503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627210/extras/b3c40f99e1f75fe5c453956fb44e6092.mp4?t=1758143503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627210/extras/5ed768fe31cd0a565543e0da2bb19215.poster.avif?t=1758143503\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627210/extras/5ed768fe31cd0a565543e0da2bb19215.webp?t=1758143503\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Investigate Haunted Mansions!\" width=700 height=220 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627210/extras/a8e8adbdce19b3d924ddb56c80c0b24f.poster.avif?t=1758143503\" aria-label=\"Footage exploring the mansion and finding a clue in a room\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627210/extras/a8e8adbdce19b3d924ddb56c80c0b24f.webm?t=1758143503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627210/extras/a8e8adbdce19b3d924ddb56c80c0b24f.mp4?t=1758143503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a winding and wacky mansion as you hunt for clues on your adventure</strong>. But watch out! These halls are filled with all sorts of devious traps and animatronic enemies! And the Mansion <i>seems to change in mysterious ways between each case</i>...</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to the bottom of the mystery by interrogating a zany cast of suspects! As you find more clues, they divulge more information!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the suspect\u2019s rooms and sniff out the clues. Beat puzzley minigames to add evidence to your clue journal!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But things can\u2019t be that easy\u2026as you collect clues, the Monster of the Week will appear to chase you away!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627210/extras/b1e58711a08586660f4051e4dce4c63c.poster.avif?t=1758143503\" width=700 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627210/extras/b1e58711a08586660f4051e4dce4c63c.webm?t=1758143503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627210/extras/d7a994348c3b05d133a8c9d1fff9655d.poster.avif?t=1758143503\" aria-label=\"Footage fighting the monsters and unmasking dracula\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627210/extras/d7a994348c3b05d133a8c9d1fff9655d.webm?t=1758143503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627210/extras/d7a994348c3b05d133a8c9d1fff9655d.mp4?t=1758143503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dracula, the Werewolf, the Mummy, and more</strong> prowl the halls of Orchard Mansion!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get enough clues and the Monster of the Week appears! <i>YIKES!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Monster of the Week appears multiple times throughout their episode, each time meaner than last!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find enough clues to <strong>incriminate the culprit</strong>, <strong>set your trap</strong>, and <strong>defeat the Monster</strong> to finally <strong>unmask it</strong>!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play in Story Mode, or Mix it Up!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Story Mode</strong>, investigate and fight your way through several cases to unravel the mystery of Orchard Mansion. Each case features a different Monster of the Week with its own set of abilities and minions, along with a unique cast of suspects and map layout to keep things fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Mixed-Up Mansion Mode</strong>, the mansion layout, suspects, and clues are randomized to mix up the way you play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the case <strong>solo</strong> or with up to 4 players in <strong>local co-op</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["LKMK GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627210/3480a7aff2bea5c7d871ab57325c5243c77856f0/header.jpg?t=1758143503","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3627210/1367212922/1cdfae0f7148e12bff9076f5c8c22d222d36d293/1758141630/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758143501","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3627210/1367212922/1cdfae0f7148e12bff9076f5c8c22d222d36d293/1758141630/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758143501","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3627210/1367212922/1cdfae0f7148e12bff9076f5c8c22d222d36d293/1758141630/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758143501","id":257200426,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257200426/movie480.mp4?t=1758143501","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257200426/movie_max.mp4?t=1758143501"},"name":"TRAILER!","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257200426/765db3ebf291f1d9a923fc34e0d19212844110d0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758143501","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257200426/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1758143501","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257200426/movie_max_vp9.we